WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.130
Last root review of the year.

00:00:02.130 --> 00:00:04.020
Port means carry.

00:00:04.020 --> 00:00:05.720
Rupt means break.

00:00:05.720 --> 00:00:07.690
Struct means build.

00:00:07.690 --> 00:00:09.570
Dict means say.

00:00:09.570 --> 00:00:12.030
They’ve been hiding in words all year.

00:00:12.030 --> 00:00:13.890
Ask what each word is doing:

00:00:13.890 --> 00:00:16.570
carrying, breaking, building, or saying.

00:00:16.570 --> 00:00:18.680
Then sew the patch.
